"2020-10-12T16:39:02Z","updated_at":"2020-10-12T16:39:02Z","body":"Hi, it doesn't work via the ext.serializer.dumps/loads either - similar traceback. We run quite a number of queries through the pickle/unpickle and only seem to get errors with queries containing the `row_number().over()`\r\n\r\n```\r\nimport sqlalchemy\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.serializer import dumps, loads\r\n\r\n\r\nquery = sqlalchemy.select([sqlalchemy.func.row_number().over().label('col1')])\r\n\r\nprint(str(query))\r\n\r\np = dumps(query)\r\nquery = loads(p)\r\n\r\n# print(str(query))\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/707226941/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"rad-pat","id":45275736,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc1NzM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45275736?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat","html_url":"https://github.com/rad-pat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rad-pat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/707231522","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5644#issuecomment-707231522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com